॰ FORK-JOIN (anuvada.py fj_plan, FORKJOIN.md): समान्तरविधिः 1 when the trace asked for it (65536 + the
॰ target) and the image calls the marker routine; then समान्तरसूचकाः[k] is 1 at each marker's first word,
॰ स्तूपलेखकाः[k] 1 at a word that writes sp (the leader rule's), समान्तरतलम् = SB + 2056, समान्तरशिखरम् = sp0
सार्वजनिक चरः समान्तरविधिः ॱॱ अ६४ भवति ० ।
