॰ E.s(v): signed LEB128. A negative v is encoded through its complement ~v = -1 - v >= 0: every
॰ 7-bit group is the complement of u's group (127 - group), and u's last-group test is the same.
वृत्तिः वसलेबः आदाय मूल्यम् ॱॱ अ६४ ददाति अ६४ आदि
